--- A function that answers `[]` on one path and a frame's column on
--- another answers two kinds, refused as any two kinds are: the empty
--- list's items were not known yet, so it had not been counted, and the
--- verifier stopped with an internal error in both modes (found writing
--- Myna's tracking, 2026-11-06)
use frame

fn shown[a]
    if a eq 1
        return []
    f = frame.new[k = ['x']]
    return f.k

log[shown[2]]
